The Matrix application-service client, SQLite store, stable-identifier helper,
secret loading and transaction surface were extracted from
FuturePresentLabs/rakazo-beeper (Apache-2.0), commit 704e1c9d6cb9:
  src/matrix.rs
  src/store.rs
  src/config.rs
  src/service.rs
  src/lib.rs (stable_id)
The Beeper/Rakazo-specific room policy, avatar renderer, acknowledgement
discipline and agent orchestration were intentionally left behind.

MeshCore is a separate project by its own contributors. Drawbridge only speaks
its companion/HTTP sidecar protocol; no MeshCore firmware is vendored here.
